<title>FRANCE: Rossignol 1996/97 sales up 11.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Rossignol 1996/97 sales up 11.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					2,367.7   vs   2,122.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Skis Rossignol said in a statement sales rose 9.1 percent on a like-for-like basis and constant exchange rates. The sports equipment firm said it estimated its share of the winter sports market had climbed to 27 percent from 24.1 a year earlier. It said it expected strong growth in sales of skis and snowboards in the current financial year.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
